msgid "difftime - calculate time difference"
msgstr "difftime - 時刻の間隔の計算"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/difftime.3:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<double difftime(time_t >I<time1>B<, time_t >I<time0>B<);>\n"
msgstr "B<double difftime(time_t >I<time1>B<, time_t >I<time0>B<);>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/difftime.3:30
msgid ""
"The B<difftime>()  function returns the number of seconds elapsed between "
"time I<time1> and time I<time0>, represented as a I<double>.  Each time is a "
"count of seconds."
msgstr ""
"関数 B<difftime>() は時刻 I<time0> から 時刻 I<time1> までの経過時間を "
"I<double> 型で返します。各々の時刻は I<double> で指定します。各々の時刻は秒数"
"で指定します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/difftime.3:36
msgid ""
"I<difftime(b,\\ a)> acts like I<(b-a)> except that the result does not "
"overflow and is rounded to I<double>."
msgstr ""
"I<difftime(b,\\\\ a)> は、結果がオーバーフローせず、I<double> に丸められるこ"
"とを除いて、I<(b-a)> と同様に動作します。"

